# Community Service (jeuno 15) again, by a card holder: completed before, the Lamp Lighter's Membership Card held (GM).
# Day 8001 4:00 (hour < 5): nil, his default 118 (the quest's finish: Wait = 8001); a GM's Wait 0; 5:00: 118 (1)
# (option 0: Wait = 8001); asked today (Wait == today): nil, default 118 (the finish again); a GM's Wait 0; 17:00 (hour
# < 18): 118 (1); 18:00 (onGameHour's notification: ZAUKO_IS_RECRUITING to the holder): 116 (1), the update
# (updateEvent(1, 1)), the twelve lamps, 117 (1, 1) answered 0 (completed again, no card given: the card is still
# held). Day 8002 5:00
# (onGameHour: the lamps closed and the zone vars cleared): 118 (1) (option 1: the card returned, YOU_RETURN_THE), then
# his default 118 (no card); a lamp at Prog 0 closed again (6).
lists LowerJeuno/Zauko/onTrigger LowerJeuno/_l00/onTrigger LowerJeuno/onEventUpdate/116 LowerJeuno/onEventFinish/117 LowerJeuno/onEventFinish/118 LowerJeuno/onEventFinish/120 LowerJeuno/onEventFinish/131
char zone=LowerJeuno pos=-2.4,0,14.2 job=WAR lvl=30
quest Jeuno.CommunityService completed
keyitem LampLightersMembershipCard
login
